        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk3-degree-p11-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "一共 + quantity",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "一共 marks a total across the relevant items or occasions. Identify what is being added; it does not mean each.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "一共有十个人。",
                "pinyin": "yīgòng yǒu shí gè rén 。",
                "meaning": "There are ten people in total.",
                "audio": "8b24f4ce5347fa6731b6c0f8c318e7b84e75666fba7ba4b133cd8274703dd72f"
              },
              {
                "text": "这两本书一共二十元。",
                "pinyin": "zhè liǎng běn shū yīgòng èr shí yuán 。",
                "meaning": "These two books cost twenty yuan altogether.",
                "audio": "9bc073238cf59cb4210362c51bfd1f616e17db7317e130d308f3fa514d889ee3"
              }
            ]
